<title>USA: Midland ISD, Texas, won by Banc One Capital.</title>
<headline>Midland ISD, Texas, won by Banc One Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital said it won $20 million of Midland ISD, Texas, school building bonds, Series 1997, with a initial rate  of 3.91.</p>
</text>
